(this.webpackJsonpisomorphic=this.webpackJsonpisomorphic||[]).push([[35],{345:function(a){a.exports=JSON.parse('{"pasarpolisBlogHeaderSubTitle":"Dapatkan informasi terbaru dan tips mengenai dunia insurtech, asuransi, kesehatan, gaya hidup, employee benefit hingga kemitraan hanya di Blog PasarPolis","pasarpolisBlogHeaderTitle":"<hightlight>Pasarpolis</hightlight> Blog","pasarpolisNewsHeaderTitle":"Siaran Pers <hightlight>PasarPolis</hightlight>","readyToHelp":"<hightlight>Kami Siap</hightlight> Membantu","homeTitle":"<hightlight>Menjadikan Asuransi Lebih</hightlight> Mudah, Terjangkau & Menyenangkan","homeSubTitle":"Mudah, Terjangkau & Menyenangkan","<hightlight>Kami Siap</hightlight> Membantu":"We\'re Here to <hightlight>Help</hightlight>","General":"General","Kenapa saya harus membeli asuransi?":"What should I buy insurance?","Karena tinggal di kota memiliki banyak resiko. Tahukah Anda, di Indonesia rata-rata 120 orang meninggal dunia setiap minggu karena kecelakaan jalan raya. 120 orang sama dengan jumlah penumpang pesawat jumbo jet! <a>Source here</a> Kita pasti takut dan cemas ketika sebuah pesawat mengalami kecelakaan, bayangkan jumlah yang sama tetapi disebabkan oleh kecelakaan jalan raya setiap minggunya! Selain itu, gaya hidup kita juga semakin beresiko terhadap berbagai macam penyakit. Makanan tinggi kolesterol dan dipenuhi berbagai bahan kimia berbahaya menyebabkan semakin tingginya resiko kita terkena berbagai penyakit berbahaya seperti jantung, kanker, gagal ginjal, diabetes, dan lainnya. Resiko ini tidak hanya menghantui orang-orang tua, tetapi semakin banyak anak muda terkena berbagai resiko penyakit akibat gaya hidup tidak sehat.":"We all know that living in a big city is pretty risky. Do you know that in Indonesia, 120 people died every week, due to road accidents. A 120-people number equals to a total number of a jumbo jet passengers! (<a>Source here</a>).  Of course, the mentioned fact is very concerning. Now imagine that due to a plane accident, such incident can also affect  the same number of people every week! Apart from that, our current lifestyle carries some health risks that can potentially result in some illness. For instance, high cholesterol consumption of food along with the chemical contained in our daily food intake, may also increase the risk of various critical illness like heart attack, cancer, kidney problem, diabetic, and others. These serious illness are not only risking old people, but surprisingly, also many people in the younger age group are also at risk nowadays due to unhealthy lifestyle.","Bagaimana asuransi dapat membantu?":"How can insurance helps solve my needs?","Meskipun Anda tak dapat terhindar dari resiko, Anda dapat melindungi dari kerugian finansial yang diakibatkan oleh beragam resiko dengan bantuan dari perusahaan asuransi yang ahli dalam pengelolaan resiko. Kami di Pasar Polis\xae sangat berharap bahwa Anda dan keluarga Anda selalu sehat dan dalam keadaan aman tentram, namun kita bersama dapat merancang rencana untuk melindungi Anda dari beragam resiko. Perusahaan asuransi mengumpulkan uang nasabah sedikit demi sedikit, disebut dengan Premi, dan membayar sejumlah uang bagi nasabah yang terkena resiko (disebut dengan Klaim).":"You cannot avoid risk but you can protect against financial losses caused by various risks with the help of insurance companies that are experts in risk management. We at PasarPolis hope that you and your family are always healthy and in a safe and secure condition, but together we can design a plan to protect you from various risks. The insurance company collects the customer\'s money, called a premium, and pays a certain amount of funds to the customer who is exposed to the risk (called a claim).","Mengapa Anda membeli asuransi?":"Why did you buy insurance?","Karena yang Anda beli adalah perlindungan bagi keluarga dari kehilangan finansial yang diakibatkan dari beragam resiko yang dapat menimpa. Misalnya, Anda memiliki suami/istri, dua anak yang masih di bawah umur, kredit pinjaman rumah dan kredit pinjaman kendaraan. Jika Anda meninggal beberapa tahun ke depan, berapa banyak uang yang dibutuhkan suami/istri Anda untuk membayar hutang, berbagai pengeluaran, termasuk biaya pendidikan anak-anak? Atau, bagaimana jika orang tua Anda tiba-tiba terserang stroke sehingga membutuhkan perawatan intensif di rumah? Bagaimana Anda membayarnya? Perlindungan Asuransi dapat melindungi Anda, usaha Anda dan orang-orang tercinta Anda dari kerugian finansial yang terkait dengan berbagai resiko yang mungkin datang. Banyak sekali beragam tipe asuransi yang dapat dipertimbangkan, termasuk asuransi jiwa, asuransi kesehatan, asuransi kecelakaan, asuransi kendaraan, asuransi kepemilikan rumah/properti, dan lain sebagainya.":"Because what you buy is protection for the family from financial loss resulting from the various risks that can befall. For example, you have a husband/wife, two minor children, a home loan, and a car loan. If you die in the next few years, how much money will your husband/wife need to pay off debts, various expenses, including children\'s education costs? Or, what if your parents suddenly had a stroke and needed intensive care at home? How do you pay for it? Insurance Protection can protect you, your business, and your loved ones from financial losses associated with various risks that may come. There are many different types of insurance to consider, including life insurance, health insurance, accident insurance, vehicle insurance, home/property insurance, and so on.","Dapatkah saya hanya mengandalkan keberuntungan agar terhindar dari resiko?":"Can I rely on luck to avoid risk?","Kadang keberuntungan tidak selalu bersama kita, tetapi kita harus selalu dapat mengendalikan hidup kita kini dan masa depan. Kita selalu dihadapkan oleh beragam resiko setiap hari, begitu pula dengan orang-orang yang kita cintai. Mengandalkan keberuntungan untuk melindungi mereka tidaklah cukup. Setiap resiko hadir dengan beragam kerugian dan kehilangan. Resiko bukan hanya kematian. Kesulitan dan kerugian finansial kerap hadir dalam setiap resiko.":"Sometimes luck is not always with us, but we must always be able to control our lives now and in the future. We are always faced with various risks every day, as well as the people we love. Relying on luck to protect them was not enough. Each risk comes with various losses and losses. Risk is not just death. Financial difficulties and losses are often present in every risk.","Perusahaan tempat saya bekerja sudah memberikan perlindungan. Cukupkah itu?":"My workplace has facilitated me with insurance. It that enough?","Sebagian dari Anda mungkin cukup beruntung mendapatkan manfaat dari asuransi yang diberikan oleh kantor Anda.":"Some of you may be lucky enough to benefit from the insurance provided by your office.","Tapi itu hanya terjamin selama Anda bekerja untuk perusahaan tersebut. Asuransi akan lebih murah jika dibeli di usia muda.":"But that is only guaranteed as long as you work for the company. Insurance will be cheaper if purchased at a young age.","Alangkah bijaksananya memiliki rencana asuransi untuk masa depan ketika Anda tak lagi bekerja untuk perusahaan tempat Anda bekerja sekarang.":"It would be wise to have an insurance plan for the future when you no longer work for the company you work for now.","Selain itu, Anda perlu perlindungan tambahan karena sebagian besar perusahaan melindungi resiko-resiko dasar sehingga lebih baik Anda memiliki perlindungan tambahan yang lebih besar dari yang diberikan oleh perusahaan tempat Anda bekerja.":"In addition, you need additional protection because most companies cover basic risks so it is better for you to have additional protection that is greater than that provided by the company you work for.","Bukankah keluarga besar bisa membantu saya jika saya membutuhkan uang?":"I think my extended family members can support my financial needs, whenever I need it. Cannot they?","Keluarga inti dan keluarga besar adalah sumber dukungan terpenting ketika kita sedang mengalami masa-masa sulit.":"The main family and extended family are the most important sources of support when we are going through difficult times.","Tetapi kita tahu bahwa biaya sehari-hari mahal dan tentunya kita enggan membebani orang lain, bukan? Lagi pula bukan hal mudah untuk mengutarakan kondisi finansial kita ketika sedang mengalami masa-masa sulit.":"But we know that everyday expenses are expensive and of course, we don\'t want to burden others, right? After all, it is not easy to express our financial condition when we are going through difficult times.","Kita harus bisa mengendalikan biaya yang mungkin muncul dari kejadian yang merugikan.":"We must be able to control the costs that may arise from adverse events.","Biarkan keluarga Anda memberikan dukungan moril ketika Anda mengalami kemalangan dan biarkan perusahaan asuransi memberikan perlindungan finansial berupa klaim.":"Let your family provide moral support when you experience misfortune and let the insurance company provide financial protection in the form of claims.","Itulah yang dilakukan asuransi untuk Anda dengan biaya yang terjangkau.":"That\'s what insurance does for you at an affordable cost.","Biaya sehari-hari sangat mahal, bagaimana saya bisa menyisihkan  uang untuk membayar premi?":"I have quite high daily expenses. How can I save up to pay for an insurance premium?","Kita seringkali menunda membeli asuransi, sementara untuk membeli gadget baru tak perlu menunda-nunda. Padahal, memiliki rencana asuransi untuk melindungi Anda dan keluarga adalah yang terpenting karena kita tak pernah tahu kapan musibah datang.":"We often delay buying insurance, while buying a new gadget does not need to delay. Having an insurance plan to protect you and your family is the most important thing because we never know when disaster strikes.","Merencanakan Asuransi":"My Insurance Plan","Bagaimana Memilih Asuransi yang Tepat?":"How to Choose the Right Insurance?","Banyak sekali pilihan asuransi yang ditawarkan saat ini, seperti asuransi jiwa, asuransi kesehatan, asuransi kendaraan, asuransi perjalanan dan asuransi lainnya. Setiap orang memiliki kebutuhan yang berbeda-beda. Maka dalam memilih asuransi yang paling tepat adalah memilih asuransi yang sesuai dengan kebutuhan Anda.":"There are so many insurance options offered today, such as life insurance, health insurance, vehicle insurance, travel insurance and other insurances. Everyone has different needs. So in choosing the most appropriate insurance is to choose the insurance that suits your needs.","Kapan Waktu yang Tepat Beli Asuransi?":"When is the Right Time to Buy Insurance?","Jika Anda bertanya kapan waktu yang tepat, tentu jawabannya adalah secepat mungkin. Semakin ditunda semakin besar risiko Anda mengalami gangguan finansial akibat hal tak terduga yang tidak diinginkan.":"If you ask when? of course the answer is as soon as possible. The more delayed the greater the risk of you experiencing financial problems due to unexpected things that are not wanted.","Bagaimana Cara Mengatur Keuangan untuk Memiliki Asuransi?":"How to Manage Finances to Have Insurance?","Ketika Anda ingin memiliki asuransi, Anda perlu mengatur finansial Anda.":"When you want to have insurance, you need to manage your finances.","Berikut 3 langkah untuk mengatur finansial:":"Here are 3 steps to manage finances:","Mengevaluasi kondisi keuangan Anda saat ini.":"Evaluate your current financial condition.","Menentukan tujuan perencanaan keuangan Anda.":"Determine your financial planning goals.","Menyusun perencanaan keuangan untuk mencapai tujuan tersebut.":"Develop financial plans to achieve these goals.","Pastikan biaya pengeluaran untuk memenuhi kebutuhan sehari-hari dan melunasi hutang/cicilan menjadi prioritas, baru Anda bisa menyisihkan uang untuk investasi dan asuransi.":"Make sure the expenses for fulfilling daily needs and paying off debts/installments are a priority, then you can set aside money for investment and insurance.","Mengajukan Klaim":"Submit a Claim","Bagaimana Mengajukan Klaim Melalui PasarPolis?":"How to make a claim through PasarPolis?","Jika Anda membeli asuransi melalui PasarPolis, pengajuan klaim sangat mudah dan praktis. Anda mengajukan klaim melalui Klaim Portal, tempat Anda juga bisa melihat informasi polis dan status klaim.":"If you bought insurance through PasarPolis, filing a claim is easy and practical. You file claims through the Claim Portal, where you can also view your policy information and claim status.","Kemudahan Dalam ":"Bringing Peace of Mind by ","Melindungi Setiap Momen Berharga":"Addressing Every Customer\u2019s Daily needs","Melalui teknologi, PasarPolis menghadirkan solusi agar semua lapisan masyarakat dapat mengakses asuransi secara praktis dengan harga terjangkau.":"We deliver insurance for everyone through an easy to access, affordable, and delightful experience through technology and innovation.","Senior Leaders":"Senior Leaders","Perjalanan <span> PasarPolis </span>":"Milestone","PasarPolis didirikan untuk mendemokratisasi asuransi yang identik dengan proses yang rumit. Melalui teknologi terkini, PasarPolis bertekad untuuk memberi kemudahan akses serta menciptakan proses asuransi agar lebih efektif, cepat dan menyenangkan.":"PasarPolis was founded to democratize insurance that many people thought as impractical and complicated. Through technology, PasarPolis has been successful in simplifying and accelerating the entire insurance journey.","PasarPolis mengembangkan tim teknologi handal yang berbasis di India. Di tahun yang sama, PasarPolis berhasil melakukan pendanaan Seri-A dengan 3 unicorn Indonesia - Gojek, Tokopedia, dan Traveloka.":"PasarPolis developed a core technology team based in India. In same year, PasarPolis successfully closed Series-A funding round with 3 Indonesian unicorns - Gojek, Tokopedia, Traveloka.","PasarPolis berekspansi ke pasar internasional - Vietnam dan Thailand - untuk menjadi penggerak industri insurtech di kawasan ASEAN.":"International expansion to Vietnam and Thailand to become a driving force for SEA\u2019s  insurtech industry.","PasarPolis meluncurkan bisnis PasarPolis Mitra.":"PasarPolis launched PasarPolis Mitra business.","PasarPolis melakukan pendanaan Seri-B dengan Leapfrog, Xiaomi, SBI Investment, Intudo Ventures, Alpha JWC Ventures, dan GoVentures.":"PasarPolis closed the Series-B funding with Leapfrog, Xiaomi, SBI Investment, Intudo Ventures, Alpha JWC Ventures, and GoVentures.","PasarPolis menyambut bergabungnya anak organisasi World Bank Group yaitu International Finance Corporation (IFC) sebagai investor.":"PasarPolis welcomed World Bank Group\'s sister organization, International Finance Corporation (IFC), as investor.","Kami tidak hanya berhenti di sini. Kami akan selalu menciptakan inovasi agar mempermudah Anda dalam berasuransi.":"Our innovations will not stop here. We will constantly create a breakthrough in making your insurance experience easy and delightful.","Pelajari Lebih Lanjut":"Learn More About","Inovasi Kami":"Our Innovations","Solusi modern untuk asuransi kesehatan karyawan dalam satu aplikasi dengan harga idaman":"Modern solutions for your employees\u2019 health insurance in one app offered at great prices.","Jualan asuransi jadi lebih mudah dan dapat bonus melimpah. Bergabunglah bersama kami dengan menjadi Mitra PasarPolis.":"Selling insurance becomes more practical and you will get great bonuses. Join us as business partners at PasarPolis Mitra.","INFO LENGKAP":"MORE INFO","Visi <span> & </span> Misi":"Vision <span> & </span> Mission","Visi":"Vision","Menjadi penyedia produk dan layanan asuransi paling diminati konsumen di Asia Tenggara melalui teknologi.":"Be South-East Asia\u2019s preferred Insurance products and services provider for consumers through technology.","Misi":"Mission","Menciptakan pengalaman berasuransi yang mudah, terjangkau dan menyenangkan bagi seluruh lapisan masyarakat, melalui teknologi & inovasi berkelanjutan.":"Making insurance experience easy, affordable and delightful for all through technology & innovation.","Kami ingin kamu memiliki pengalaman yang {br} menyenangkan dalam berasuransi dengan:":"We want you to have a delightful {br} insurance experience by providing:","Dampak Positif <span>PasarPolis</span>":"<span>Positive</span> Social Impact","Kami bertekad untuk menjembatani kesenjangan akses asuransi bagi mereka yang belum pernah tersentuh asuransi sebelumnya, dan juga masyakarat pra-sejahtera melalui produk asuransi yang lebih mudah diakses dan terjangkau bagi seluruh lapisan masyarakat. Melalui teknologi, kami berkomitmen untuk terus berinovasi menciptakan pengalaman berasuransi yang lebih menyenangkan sesuai dengan kebutuhan yang melekat di dalam keseharian konsumen.":"We aim to bridge the insurance gaps for the uninsured and the underserved families by delivering insurance for everyone through an easy to access and affordable insurance products. Through technology, we are committed to innovate an insurance loved by all by making the entire insurance journey more delightful for the consumers.","1 Miliar+ polis diterbitkan (2019-2021). Melayani 24+ juta populasi Indonesia*":"1 Billion+ policies issued (2019-2021); Serving 24+ Million Indonesian population*","*90% di antaranya adalah nasabah pemula (1st time buyer)":"*90% of which is 1st time buyers","*40% di antaranya adalah pekerja informal (pengemudi ojek daring, kurir, UMKM, dll)":"*40% of which is informal workers (online motorcycle taxi drivers, courier,  MSMEs\u2019 workers, etc)","<span>60,000+</span> Mitra terdaftar di PasarPolis Mitra":"<span>60,000+</span> Registered Mitra","<span>50+</span> Partner Asuransi":"<span>50+</span> Insurance Partners","<span>40+<span> Ecosystem Partners":"<span>40+</span> Ecosystem Partners","<span>>5x Pertumbuhan Bisnis</span> (GWP YoY 2021 vs 2020)":"<span>>5x Growth</span> (GWP YoY 2021 vs 2020)","<span>Menjadikan Asuransi Lebih</span> {br} Mudah, Terjangkau & Menyenangkan":"<span>Making</span> Insurance Easy, Affordable {br}& Delightful","<span>Dengan PasarPolis</span> Semua Serba Menyenangkan":"Delightfulness in <span>PasarPolis</span>","Melalui inovasi and teknologi, PasarPolis mengubah pengalaman berasuransi menjadi lebih menyenangkan di dalam keseharian masyarakat melalui perlindungan yang lebih mudah diakses, terjangkau biayanya, dan proses yang tidak ribet  mulai dari penerbitan polis hingga proses klaim yang praktis dan cepat.":"Through innovation and technology, PasarPolis is embedding peace of mind into every customer\u2019s daily activity by delivering a more delightful insurance journey that is easy to access, more affordable, and frictionless from instant policy issuance to easy and fast claim process. PasarPolis gives protection to everything that matters to you day in day out.","Beragam Produk yang Melekat di Dalam Keseharian Anda":"Various Products to Solve Your Daily Needs","Proses Beli & Klaim Asuransi Yang Praktis":"Practical Insurance Purchase & Claim Process","Proses Klaim Instan":"Instant Claim Process","<span>Pelajari Lebih Lanjut</span> Inovasi Kami":"<span>Learn More About</span> Our Innovations","Partner <span>Kami</span>":"<span>PasarPolis</span> Partners","Partner Penyedia Asuransi":"Insurance Providers","Partner E-Commerce/Aplikasi":"Ecosystem Partners","Partner Media":"Media Partners","<span>Alasan Pelanggan</span> Mempercayai PasarPolis":"<span>What Did</span> They Said About Us?","Terima kasih untuk servisnya yang luar biasa, klaim yang cepat dan prosesnya mudah.":"Thanks for the great service, fast claim & easy process.","Saya driver gojek. Hp saya terjatuh dan rusak karena terlindas mobil. Setelah saya ajukan klaim ke PasarPolis, alhamdulillah klaim diterima dan dana klaim langsung ditrasnfer ke rekening saya. Terimah kasih PasarPolis Indonesia.":"I\u2019m a Gojek driver. I had my phone fell off, then broken because it got run over by a car. I submitted my claim to PasarPolis by following through all the required steps. Alhamdulillah, the claim was granted and I received the transferred claim fund right away. Thanks, PasarPolis Indonesia.","Saya beli asuransi Gosure untuk smartphone ku. Bener-bener mudah buat melindungi smarphone ku, yang aku lakukan cuma scan bar code. Kita perlu pakai lebih banyak teknologi seperti ini di masa depan untuk perusahaan asuransi. Terima kasih PasarPolis.":"I bought Gosure insurance for my Vivo smartphone. Such an easy way to protect my phone, all I needed to do was to scan barcodes and my insurance was all set. We need to use more technology like this in the future for insurance companies. Thanks PasarPolis.","keren sekali, sy gak nyangka aja, cuman iseng2 aja ikut kan di pembelian tiket. Pas ternya emmg delay, sy klaim.. gak ribet, gak ada syarat. gak sampe 1 jam langsung cair 250rb x 2 org = 500rb. pdhl hrg tiket untuk 2 org 800rb. pokokx salut sekali":"It\'s cool, I didn\'t expect it. I bought insurance when I bought a plane ticket and there was a delay. Then I claim and the process is easy. In less than 1 hour, the funds will go directly to the account of IDR 250,000 x 2 people = IDR 500,000. For your information, the ticket price for two people is IDR 800,000","Sangat puas dengan servisnya. Klaim dan dana kompensasinya masuk dengan cepat. Terima kasih PasarPolis \ud83d\udc4d  \ud83e\udd29":"I am very statisfied with the service provided. Fast claims and funds transferred immediately after the process is validated. Thank you Pasar Polis \ud83d\udc4d  \ud83e\udd29","Beli tiket pesawat dari pegi-pegi dan kena delay 1 jam. Saya langsung dapet notifikasi dari PasarPolis dan dapat kompensasinya super cepat.":"Bought my flight from pegi-pegi website and it got delayed for 1 hour. I immediately received instant notification from PasarPolis and super fast hassle free flight delay claim.","Pelayanan sangat memuaskan, hp saya note 9, asuransi layar pecah, 8 bln kemudian hp saya retak dan pecah untung ada PasarPolis yg bisa membantu asuransi layar retak/pecah, total klaim saya 3 jt dibayar penuh. Trima kasih pasarpolis\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude01":"Very satisfying service. Has bought screen insurance for my Note 9. 8 months after buying insurance, my cellphone cracked and broke, fortunately, there was PasarPolis who could help, the total claim was 3 million rupiahs and paid in full. Thank you, PasarPolis \ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude4f\ud83d\ude01","Alhamdulillah klaim kerusakan LCD HP saya telah selesai diproses, overall sebenarnya pengajuannya ga sulit dan ribet yang penting kelengkapan bukti pendukung yg di minta bisa dilengkapi dan sesuai.":"Alhamdulillah, my smartphone LCD damage claim has been processed. Overall the submission is not difficult and easy. The important thing is that the supporting evidence requested can be completed and appropriate.","Terimakasih pasarpolis, asuransi yg sangat murah membantu para driver gojek dan sangat mudah proses klaimnya dan sangat cepat.":"Thank you, PasarPolis, for very affordable insurance that can help Gojek drivers. The claim process is easy and fast.","Saya akan merekomendasikan PasarPolis jika Anda mencari broker asuransi. Waktu mobil saya tertabrak, PasarPolis membantu saya dan tentunya apa yang diberikan sesuai dengan penawaran di awal beli asuransi.":"I would recommend PasarPolis if you are looking for an insurance broker. When my car was hit, PasarPolis helped me and of course, what was given was under the offer at the beginning of buying insurance.","pelayanan sangat cepat responnya. flight delay langsung diproses pencairan klaim. Sempat ada kendala tapi customer servicenya sangat membantu jadi lancar dan mudah sekali proses klaimnya. Ga perlu sampai 24 jam, dana klaim sudah masuk ke rekening":"Fast service. Flight delay claims are immediately processed and the claim process is easy. It doesn\u2019t take up to 24 hours, the claim funds have entered the account","karena sesuatu hal saya membatalkan pembelian tiket pesawat via toped.. Alhamdulillah karena ikut asuransi via pasarpolis.. refund tiket mudah dan penggantian sesuai dgn nilai yg qt bayarkan (100%) tanpa potongan apapun.. tengkiuuu pasarpolis":"For some reason, I canceled my flight ticket purchase via Tokopedia. Alhamdulillah, because I bought insurance via PasarPolis, ticket refunds were easy and replacements were according to the value I paid (100%) without any deductions. Thank you PasarPolis","Terimakasih untuk PasarPolis klaim yang saya ajukan karena kecelakaan sudah di cairin, pelayanannya cepat dan memuaskan.":"Thank you PasarPolis, the claim I submitted due to an accident was received quickly and the service was satisfactory.","Prosesnya cepat hanya 1 hari langsung cair\u2026next klo terbang kemana2 ikut asuransi dr pasar polis..jadi aman dan tenang\u2026recommended bgt":"The process is fast, only 1 day, and claim funds are immediately received. Next time I fly, I will buy insurance from PasarPolis, to feel safe. Highly recommended","Beli polisnya gampang, dan pas klaim cepet juga ternyata. Makasih ya":"Buying the policy is easy, and when you make a claim, it turns out to be fast. Thank you","Terima kasih ya Pasar Polis, kini perjalanan terasa nyaman dan aman. Klaim tanpa ribet. Maju terus dan sukses selalu untuk Pasar Polis. Luar biasa.. \ud83d\udc4d":"Thank you PasarPolis, now the trip feels comfortable and safe. Claim without hassle. Keep going and success always for PasarPolis. Amazing.. \ud83d\udc4d","Tentang PasarPolis":"About PasarPolis","Ajukan Klaim":"Submit Claim","Karir":"Career","Artikel":"Article","FAQ":"FAQ","Siaran Pers":"Press Release","Blog":"Blog","Didirikan pada tahun 2015, PasarPolis kini merupakan platform insurance technology (insurtech) terdepan di Asia Tenggara. Misi PasarPolis adalah untuk merevolusi asuransi sehingga dapat diakses dengan lebih mudah, cepat, dan tepat sasaran dengan menggunakan teknologi terkini. Teknologi PasarPolis memastikan pengalaman konsumen yang bebas hambatan mulai dari pemilihan produk hingga proses klaim. Setelah lebih dari enam tahun beroperasi, PasarPolis telah menjadi salah satu yang terdepan di industri insurtech Asia Tenggara dengan fokus ingin senantiasa menghadirkan produk asuransi yang terjangkau seluruh lapisan masyarakat. PasarPolis juga turut bangga bisa menjadi perusahaan tanah air yang berhasil melebarkan sayap operasionalnya ke Thailand dan Vietnam.":"Established in 2015, PasarPolis is Southeast Asia\u2019s largest Insurance Technology (insurtech) platform. PasarPolis\u2019 mission is to redefine insurance so that it can be accessed more easily, quickly, and on target by utilizing the latest technology. PasarPolis\u2019 technology ensures a seamless consumer experience from product selection to claims. After over six years, PasarPolis has become one of the insurtech industry leaders in Indonesia with a focus on affordable insurance products. PasarPolis has also invoked national pride after it started operations in Thailand and Vietnam.","Informasi":"Information","Kantor kami":"Our offices","BERAFILIASI DENGAN":"AFFILIATED WITH:","PT PasarPolis Insurance Broker terdaftar dan diawasi oleh":"PT PASARPOLIS INSURANCE BROKER IS REGISTERED AND SUPERVISED BY:","Kamus Asuransi":"Insurance Dictionary","Pengembang":"Developer","Perusahaan":"Company","Klaim Asuransi {br}<span>Jadi Lebih Mudah</span>":"<span>Insurance</span> Claims{br}Made Easier","Ajukan klaim Anda langsung melalui Klaim Portal":"Submit your claim directly through our Claim Portal","Kunjungi Klaim Portal":"Visit Claim Portal","<span>Langkah Mudah Untuk</span> Klaim":"Easy Steps <span>to Claim:</span>","Masuk menggunakan nomor polis yang tertera di sertifikat polis, atau nomor ponsel beserta OTP Anda.":"Log in with the policy number shown on your policy certificate, or with your phone number and OTP.","Isi Form & Dokumen":"Fill the Form & Documents","Lengkapi form klaim dan unggah dokumen sesuai dengan manfaat yang Anda pilih.":"Complete the claim form and upload the documents for the benefit you selected.","Proses Verifikasi":"Verification Process","Klaim dan dokumen Anda diperiksa oleh tim kami, dan Anda akan diberi tahu begitu prosesnya selesai.":"Your claim and documents are reviewed by our team, and you will be notified once the process is complete.","Pencairan Dana":"Fund Disbursement","Dana klaim ditransfer ke rekening bank Anda setelah klaim disetujui.":"Claim funds are transferred to your bank account once your claim is approved.","Klaim Portal":"Claim Portal","Masuk ke Klaim Portal dengan nomor polis atau nomor ponsel Anda, lalu ajukan klaim dan pantau statusnya di satu tempat.":"Log in to the Claim Portal with your policy number or phone number, then submit a claim and track its status in one place.","Sistem Klaim Proaktif":"Proactive Claim System","Kami mendeteksi setiap polis yang diklaim dan langsung memberi tahu Anda. Hanya dengan beberapa klik dari notifikasi, dana klaim Anda dicairkan.":"We detect every claim filed on your policy and notify you right away. A few clicks from the notification and your claim is paid out.","Status Klaim Bisa Anda Pantau":"Track Your Claim Status","Ikuti setiap tahap klaim Anda di Klaim Portal, dari dokumen diterima sampai klaim selesai.":"Follow every stage of your claim in the Claim Portal, from documents received to claim completed.","Selamat datang Calon PasPolers!":"Welcome Future PasPolers!","Di sini":"HERE","Temukan pekerjaan impianmu":"Discover your dream jobs","Buat Perubahan Yang Bermakna":"Make Meaningful Changes","Kami tidak sebatas memberikan perlindungan bagi banyak individu dan banyak keluarga, namun lebih dari itu, kami terus berupaya membuat kehidupan masyarakat luas menjadi lebih tenang tanpa rasa khawatir. Kami ingin mengajak Anda bergabung berama PasarPolis guna mewujudkan aspirasi untuk menciptakan perubahan bermakna di dalam keseharian masyarakat luas. Bersama, seluruh tim PasPolers mengusung misi untuk mendemokratisasi asuransi agar lebih mudah diakses serta lebih terjangkau oleh seluruh lapisan masyarakat agar kualitas kehidupan mereka menjadi lebih baik karena berbagai kebutuhan hidup mereka terlah terlindungi.":"PasarPolis is not only limited to protecting you but also makes you better. We believe our protection, used by millions of people, changes every aspect of their lives for the more positive. Starting going to the office every morning worry-free, safe online shopping to support your passion, or even a stress-free vacation. We are looking for you! Those who want change and bring about meaningful change. Together with technology, we will democratize insurance to be accessible, so that everyone can run fast towards their dreams.","Nilai Inti":"Core Values","Kami mendorong PasPolers bersikap layaknya wirausahawan dalam menjalankan pekerjaan.":"We empower you to act like a company owner","Bagi kami di PasarPolis, setiap hari selalu mengusung semangat hari pertama. Kami selalu mengerahkan energi dan antusiasme layaknya hari pertama berada di PasarPolis.":"At PasarPolis, every day is always the first day for us. We always exert energy and enthusiasm like the first day at PasarPolis","Kami saling mendukung kinerja satu sama lain agar bisa menjadi lebih berhasil, karena sukses tidak akan tercapai tanpa berkolaborasi.":"We help each other to be more successful because no one can be successful without collaborating.","Kami melihat perubahan yang cepat/pesat sebagai satu-satunya yang konstan dan tidak terelakkan di era digital ini. Kami akan selalu beradaptasi, berkembang, dan tetap berpikiran terbuka untuk merangkul perubahan tersebut.":"Rapid change is the only constant in the digital age and is unavoidable. We are always adopting, evolving, and keeping an open mind to embrace those changes.","Pekerjaan kami adalah komitmen kami. Kami bertekad untuk tidak pernah menyerah pada komitmen tersebut, sebagai nilai yang tertanam di dalam diri kami.":"Our work is our commitment. We are committed and determined to never give up on commitments because these are our values.","Mari Kita Berkarya dan Berinovasi Bersama":"Work With Us","Menjadi bagian dari keluarga besar PasarPolis untuk menciptakan Perubahan positif.":"Join our family and let\u2019s make history!","Kebiakan Privasi":"Privacy Policy"}')}}]);
